'''Nymeve Lake''',<ref name="Life Debt" /> or '''Lake Nymeve''',<ref name="Encyclopedia">{{EncyclopediaCite|Kashyyyk and Other Planets in the Mid Rim}}</ref> was a [[Water|freshwater]] lake on the [[planet]] [[Takodana]]. On its shoreline rested an [[Takodana Castle|ancient castle]] run by the [[pirate]] [[Maz Kanata]], who had a parapet overlooking the lake.<ref name="TVD">''[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> During the [[High Republic Era]], a [[Jedi Temple (Takodana)|Jedi Temple]] sat on the opposite side of the lake from Maz's castle.<ref name="HRA 8" /> An [[Arquitens-class command cruiser|Imperial light cruiser]] once crashed into the lake after being critically damaged in a [[Skirmish on Takodana|battle]] with [[New Republic]] [[starfighter]]s.<ref name="Battlefront II" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[2015]] film [[Star Wars: Episode VII The Force Awakens|''Star Wars'': Episode VII ''The Force Awakens'']], the ''[[Millennium Falcon]]'' is [[pilot]]ed over Nymeve Lake as it approaches Maz Kanata's castle. Here, the lake pictured is taken from footage of [[Wikipedia:Derwentwater|Derwent Water]] of the [[Wikipedia:Lake District|Lake District]], in the northwest of [[Wikipedia:England|England]].<ref name="Lake District">{{WebCite|url=http://www.manchestereveningnews.co.uk/news/greater-manchester-news/star-wars-filmed-lake-district-10597811|text=Watch: Fascinating video pinpointing exactly where Star Wars scenes were filmed in the Lake District|date=2015-12-14|work=Manchester Evening News|archivedate=20170714174849}}</ref>

